"source":"build_graph.py",
"code":"import sys\n\n\ndef main() -> None:\n    raw = sys.stdin.read()\n    data = raw.split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    n = int(data[0])\n    m = int(data[1])\n\n    g = [\n        [] for _ in range(n)\n    ]\n    pos = 2\n    for _ in range(m):\n        a = int(data[pos])\n        b = int(data[pos+1])\n        pos += 2\n        g[a].append(b)\n        g[b].append(a)\n\n    for v in range(n):\n        print(f\"{v}: {g[v]}\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n",
"alt":"The program reads a vertex count, an edge count, then that many edges, appending each endpoint to the other's neighbor list before printing every vertex's list.",
